---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Tools — Orkaid"
  description="The Orkaid hub for free professional tools."
  pathname="/tools/"
>
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tool hub</p>
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <p>The tool hub foundation is ready. The XRechnung generator itself is not part of this technical bootstrap.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="status-heading">
    <h2 id="status-heading">Status</h2>
    <dl class="tool-status">
      <dt>Platform</dt>
      <dd>Foundation ready</dd>
      <dt>XRechnung</dt>
      <dd><span class="status-highlight">In development</span></dd>
    </dl>
    <p>Development is documented in the <a href="https://orkaid.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">public build log</a>. The source code is on <a href="https://github.com/orkaid/orkaid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
